Z||000003||theogre||03-04-2000||04:39 PM||||MotorMite's red Help! packages Do have a pin kit for the Fiero. You want the #38407 package. ((It's the shorter of the 2 GM pin sets.)) you need 2 kits per door. ((I hope you didn't buy just the bushings at the dealler.... you won't need them.))||||reg||10
